## Pharmacy

::bg{location="pharmacy" time="night"}
@narrator: Shelves of brown bottles, labels curled like fingernails. Every one of them has been opened.
@narrator: Hanging on a hook by the hatch: a key tag stamped MORTUARY. In the fridge, which should not be cold and is, a single loaded syringe with a label in green ink: FOR A.C. ONLY.
@nell{mono}: A.C. Whoever that is, they needed putting down on a schedule.
